OL,3,AFed has 'work to do' if price rises
OL,4,Adon't ease for Americans, Warsh says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest figures showed prices rose
OL,7,F3.4% in the year to July, above the
OL,8,FFed's 2% target.
